        "eyebrow": "About Sacred Creations",
        "heading": "Modern alchemy.",
        "heading_accent": "Ancient wisdom.",
        "text": "<p>Sacred Creations is a family brand from Albuquerque, New Mexico, founded by husband and wife Adonai and Kaylee Romero. We make natural, intentional products from ingredients of the earth, starting with Liquid Gold: three clean ingredients, crafted by hand with prayer and intention.</p>",
        "built_in": "founders",
        "image_alt": "Adonai and Kaylee Romero with their child, smiling outdoors",
        "only_on_page": "about"
      }
    },
    "about-story": {
      "type": "sc-about-story",
      "settings": {
        "surface": "paper",
        "eyebrow": "How it began",
        "heading": "It began",
        "heading_accent": "with our family.",
        "text": "<p>Sacred Creations began when Kaylee was pregnant. Preparing to raise our family in a state of well-being, we looked closely at everything around us: our clothes, dishes, cookware, cleaners, body products and furniture. We stopped settling for blends and ingredients we couldn't name, and moved beyond organic toward truly natural living, made from the earth and free of petroleum and toxins.</p><p>We soon saw we weren't the only ones who cared, yet it was so hard to find products that support health instead of harming it. Skincare was the clearest gap. We couldn't find a single face moisturizer that wasn't built on petroleum or fragrance hidden behind lab-made names we couldn't pronounce. Change had to begin with us. So Liquid Gold was born.</p>",
        "quote": "We believe every action in life is sacred, and our goal is to share intentional living with everyone.",
        "quote_by": "",
        "only_on_page": "about"
      }
    },
    "about-name": {
      "type": "sc-about-story",
      "settings": {
        "surface": "wall",
        "eyebrow": "Why “sacred”",
        "heading": "Intention",
        "heading_accent": "is sacred.",
        "text": "<p>The name is a nod to our Creator, who we see in every part of this human experience: in a ceramic mug, the wall of our home, the plant on the windowsill. We hope our products bring that same awareness quietly into your days.</p><p>Everything we make is created with prayer and intention for the person who will use it. We charge each bottle with tools we truly believe spread love and help create a better world.</p>",
        "quote": "",
        "quote_by": "",
        "only_on_page": "about"
      }
    },
