    "about-trinity": {
      "type": "sc-about-story",
      "settings": {
        "surface": "wall",
        "eyebrow": "Liquid Gold",
        "heading": "A holy",
        "heading_accent": "trinity.",
        "text": "<p>Castor, jojoba and frankincense. Each one supports the others, and you. In spirituality, medicine and nature, things that come in threes have long been known to be powerful, and these three are no exception.</p><p>The oil rests on our altar for at least 21 days. That time lets the raw frankincense resin infuse into the oils, adding its own character alongside the essential oil and giving Liquid Gold its golden sheen.</p>",
        "quote": "",
        "quote_by": "",
        "only_on_page": "about"
      }
    },
