        "heading": "Made slowly,",
        "heading_accent": "on purpose.",
        "text": "Cleansing lets us begin in a clear state. As we craft, each ingredient is poured with its own intention for you to receive: beauty, abundance, clarity and protection. Then it rests and is charged on the altar.",
        "affirmation": "I anoint this temple with ancient light. With every drop, I release the old and reveal my true radiance. I am grounded. I am pure. I am golden.",
