        "eyebrow": "Our promise",
        "heading": "What we will",
        "heading_accent": "never compromise.",
        "text": "<p>We believe a more beautiful world is possible, and that it begins with the products we make and the businesses behind them. When you use Liquid Gold, we pray you feel nourished, clean, abundant and beautiful: safe in your body, confident in your choices, and clear about what goes onto your skin and why.</p>",
