    "about-home": {
      "type": "sc-about-story",
      "settings": {
        "surface": "paper",
        "eyebrow": "Rooted in Albuquerque",
        "heading": "Made in",
        "heading_accent": "New Mexico.",
        "text": "<p>The land here shapes our designs, our colors and our connection to the earth. The indigenous culture of natural living and art here fuels our souls.</p><p>We also know our community doesn't already have the access to clean products that cities like LA, San Francisco or New York do. Sacred Creations is here to help change that, for our families and yours.</p><p>Before Sacred Creations, we were sound healers. Through those offerings we met so many people facing the same problem: not knowing what everyday products were doing to them, or not knowing where to find something better. We committed to changing that through our devotion to spreading awareness and wellness.</p>",
        "quote": "",
        "quote_by": "",
        "only_on_page": "about"
      }
    },
